---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="buildings" title="Building Events" active="building-events" pageMark="🧱">
  The choices that can appear when a city finishes an ordinary
  <a href={`${base}urban-improvements`}>building or improvement</a>, such as a Barracks, Library, Market,
  Temple, Quarry or Grove. As with <a href={`${base}wonder-events`}>wonder</a> and
  <a href={`${base}project-events`}>project</a> events, each building has its own weighted pool: finishing a
  Quarry might roll <em>Ancient Statue</em>, a <em>Dinosaur Bones</em> story, or <em>Disturbed Rest</em>.
</EventGroupPage>
